)               GCOUNT  =                    1 / group count (not used)                         INHERIT =                    T / inherit the primary header                     EXTNAME = 'APERTURE'           / name of extension                              EXTVER  =                    1 / extension version number (not format version)  SIMDATA =                    F / file is based on simulated data                TELESCOP= 'TESS    '           / telescope                                      INSTRUME= 'TESS Photometer'    / detector type                                  OBJECT  = 'TIC 156920762'      / string version of target id                    TICID   =            156920762 / unique tess target identifier                  RADESYS = 'ICRS    '           / reference frame of celestial coordinates       RA_OBJ  =  99.2875852100546700 / [deg] right ascension                          DEC_OBJ = -45.2750507023065000 / [deg] declination                              EQUINOX =               2000.0 / equinox of celestial coordinate system         WCSAXES =                    2 / number of WCS axes                             CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN'           / right ascension coordinate type                CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN'           / declination coordinate type                    CRPIX1  =    6.296007748938337 / [pixel] reference pixel along image axis 1     CRPIX2  =    6.388082227197174 / [pixel] reference pixel along image axis 2     CRVAL1  =  99.2875852100546700 / [deg] right ascension at reference pixel       CRVAL2  = -45.2750657910507700 / [deg] declination at reference pixel           CUNIT1  = 'deg     '           / physical unit in column dimension              CUNIT2  = 'deg     '           / physical unit in row dimension                 CDELT1  =   -0.005686262952271 / [deg] pixel scale in RA dimension              CDELT2  = 0.005686262952271459 / [deg] pixel scale in Dec dimension             PC1_1   =  -0.8441731518285446 / linear transformation element c